    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6480" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναδρομ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>running up:</i> hence,
				<i>sprouting, impulse,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				4.5.1
			</span></i>; <i>shooting up,</i> of plant, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; <i>bud, burgeon,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				766
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				855
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>ascent,</i> of the soul, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				209
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς θεόν, εἰς τὸν ὄντως
				ἑαυτόν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Marc.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Abst.</u>
				1.29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>climbing up,</i> of a tree, <i><span class="en">
				Agatharch.
				51
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Rhet.,
				<i>returning</i> to a point, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				p.376
			</span></i> H. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>place of refuge,</i> Poet. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				102
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>running back, retreat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				5.2.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>reflux,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναικείων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Liqu.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>sudden throb</i> of pain, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				308
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				310
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνῖξις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Steph.
				<u>in Hp.</u>
				1.316
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i></div>
